n countrymen]. However, paragraphing is not used effectively to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4086124200853439, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sequence ideas, so more effective paragraphing could increase the score.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43694280788087403, "w": 0.7518398102960274, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There are some strong examples of vocabulary [comes down to one point I forces", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4652731579550117, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "us to I look after the needs of] with some higher-level collocation. However, the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49362825326263643, "w": 0.8265671733757458, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "level of error is quite high and detracts from the score for lexis. Grammatical", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5218102828214214, "w": 0.8264782842407971, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "range is also fairly wide, but again, the errors and missing punctuation mean that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5501406706169515, "w": 0.8259463847804577, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the response cannot score more highly.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5784710584124816, "w": 0.4044804481324721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "To achieve a higher score, the candidate should provide greater clarity when", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6068014084866192, "w": 0.826033428466238, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "extending the main ideas, and use more effective paragraphing to organise ideas", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6351318340035419, "w": 0.8262681080854972, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "